WEBVTT

00:34:56.658 --> 00:35:00.549
get customer-obsessed and just focus
on solving for the customer.

00:35:00.573 --> 00:35:05.246
And the notion of what winning is
and competitiveness,

00:35:05.270 --> 00:35:08.383
you know, maybe that gets
into personality,

00:35:08.407 --> 00:35:10.342
but I think you see it,

00:35:10.366 --> 00:35:13.959
I think there are certain founders
who exude a bit more of a competitiveness

00:35:13.983 --> 00:35:15.149
in the way that they --

00:35:15.173 --> 00:35:17.733
it's a bit more of a combative
approach to business,

00:35:17.757 --> 00:35:19.784
and they're able to rally people behind it

00:35:19.808 --> 00:35:21.712
and get people to do amazing things,

00:35:21.736 --> 00:35:22.898
and there's others

00:35:22.922 --> 00:35:26.083
that maybe that's not as much
a part of the way that they engage

00:35:26.107 --> 00:35:27.659
and that they talk about it.

00:35:28.005 --> 00:35:30.353
But it was definitely
part of our language.